           MOVE 1 TO MESSAGE-LEN OF BZ-ASSERT
           STRING 'COMPARE FAILED IN PROCEDURE DIVISION.'
             DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO MESSAGE-TXT OF BZ-ASSERT
             WITH POINTER MESSAGE-LEN OF BZ-ASSERT
