                               BZ-P2
                               BZ-P3
                               BZ-ASSERT
           .
       9110-CALL-BZUTRACE.
           SUBTRACT 1 FROM TRACE-LEN OF BZ-TRACE
           CALL BZUTRACE USING BZ-TRACE
