           DISPLAY 'AZU0000I *------------------------------------------
      -    ''
           PERFORM 9100-CALL-BZUASSRT
      *
           MOVE 1 TO TRACE-LEN OF BZ-TRACE
           MOVE 1 TO AZ-ITEM-NAME-S
           PERFORM UNTIL AZ-ITEM-NAME-S > AZ-COMPARE-ITEM-NAME-LEN
             MOVE 206 TO AZ-ITEM-NAME-LEN
