           SUBTRACT 1 FROM MESSAGE-LEN OF BZ-ASSERT
           SET ADDRESS OF AZ-COMPARE-ITEM-NAME
                                             TO AZ-COMPARE-ITEM-NAME-PTR
           SET ADDRESS OF AZ-COMPARE-ITEM-VALUE
                                            TO AZ-COMPARE-ITEM-VALUE-PTR
