           GOBACK
           .
       9000-UTILITY-SECTION SECTION.
       9020-CALL-BZUGTMEM.
           CALL BZUGTMEM USING DATA-SIZE
                         RETURNING DATA-PTR
           .
       END PROGRAM 'GTMEMRC'.
