           AZ-INFO-BLOCK AZ-APLIST ARGO1 ARGO2.
           DISPLAY 'AZU0000I DB2_00E7_INQCUST CHECK VALUES...'
           MOVE 0 TO RETURN-CODE.
           MOVE SQL-STMT-NUM OF AZ-APLIST TO AZ-STMT-NUM
           SET ADDRESS OF AZ-SQLDA TO SQL-VPARMPTR
